###Endpoints para rol ADMIN (requiere JWT con rol = ROLE_ADMIN)
# 1. Ejecuta el login y copia el token en la variable @token.
# En dev el admin es admin@jobsi.local / Admin12345 (o ADMIN_EMAIL / ADMIN_PASSWORD).
@token =

### Login como administrador
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@jobsi.local",
  "password": "Admin12345"
}

### Health check (publico; con token ADMIN muestra el detalle)
GET http://localhost:8080/health
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------- METRICAS ----------------

### Metricas del dashboard
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/admin/metrics
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------- USUARIOS ----------------

### Listado paginado (filtros opcionales: documento, correo, rol, bloqueado)
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/admin/users?page=0&size=10&bloqueado=false
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Consultar un usuario por documento
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/admin/users/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buscar usuarios (lista sin datos de paginacion)
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/admin/users/search?rol=USER
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Bloquear usuario
PATCH http://localhost:8080/v1/admin/users/2/block
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Desbloquear usuario
PATCH http://localhost:8080/v1/admin/users/2/unblock
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cambiar rol (USER / ADMIN)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/v1/admin/users/2/role
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "rol": "ADMIN"
}

### Eliminar usuario (solo si no tiene trabajos ni postulaciones; si no, 409)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/v1/admin/users/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Roles disponibles
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/admin/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------- CATEGORIAS ----------------

GET http://localhost:8080/v1/admin/category-all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/admin/category/tareas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/admin/category/create
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "nombre": "Categoria Prueba"
}

###
PUT http://localhost:8080/v1/admin/category/Categoria Prueba
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "nombre": "Categoria Renombrada"
}

### Eliminar (409 si hay trabajos con esa categoria)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/v1/admin/category/Categoria Renombrada
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------- ESTADOS ----------------

GET http://localhost:8080/v1/admin/state-all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/admin/create/state
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "nombre": "EN_REVISION"
}

### PENDIENTE, ASIGNADO, FINALIZADO y CANCELADO estan protegidos (409)
PUT http://localhost:8080/v1/admin/state/EN_REVISION
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "nombre": "REVISION"
}

###
DELETE http://localhost:8080/v1/admin/state/REVISION
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------- GENEROS ----------------

GET http://localhost:8080/v1/admin/gender-all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/admin/gender/create
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "nombre": "No binario"
}

###
PUT http://localhost:8080/v1/admin/gender/No binario
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "nombre": "No binarie"
}

### 409 si hay usuarios con ese genero
DELETE http://localhost:8080/v1/admin/gender/No binarie
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------- TIPOS DE PAGO ----------------

GET http://localhost:8080/v1/admin/payment-all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/admin/payment/create
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "nombre": "NEQUI"
}

###
PUT http://localhost:8080/v1/admin/payment/NEQUI
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "nombre": "DAVIPLATA"
}

###
DELETE http://localhost:8080/v1/admin/payment/DAVIPLATA
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------- CATEGORIAS DE VALORACION ----------------

GET http://localhost:8080/v1/admin/rating-category-all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ojo: finalizar un trabajo exige una puntuacion por cada categoria
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/admin/rating-category/create
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "nombre": "Amabilidad"
}

### ---------------- UBICACIONES ----------------

POST http://localhost:8080/v1/ubication
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "nombre": "Biblioteca"
}

###
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/ubication
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
DELETE http://localhost:8080/v1/ubication/Biblioteca
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------- INSTITUCIONES ----------------

POST http://localhost:8080/v1/admin/create-institution
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "nombre": "institucion prueba",
  "departamentoCodigo": "ANT",
  "municipioCodigo": "MED"
}

### Eliminar por id (ver GET /v1/public/institutions-all)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/v1/admin/institution/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------- MODERACION ----------------

### Trabajos (filtros: titulo, categoria, estado, solicitanteCorreo, page, size)
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/admin/jobs?estado=PENDIENTE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancelar trabajo (cierra sus postulaciones pendientes)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/v1/admin/jobs/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Eliminar trabajo con sus postulaciones y valoraciones
DELETE http://localhost:8080/v1/admin/jobs/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Todas las postulaciones
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/admin/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
